<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Old Kent Financial started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Old Kent Financial started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Thomas Hanley initiated coverage of Old Kent Financial Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- the stock was flat at 54-3/4.</p>
</text>
